{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Drummer is an action-platformer DRPG where you play as a lone drummer on a sacred quest to restore harmony to a fractured world. Use a fully playable step-sequencer drum kit to reshape reality, awaken lost musicians, and bring music back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven progression</strong>: unfold the mythos of the music Gods and restore harmony through ritual, rhythm, platforming, and combat.\u00a01-2 hours of gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.poster.avif?t=1771358721\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.webm?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.mp4?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable step-sequencer drum kit</strong>: create rhythms freely and shape the world through tempo and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.poster.avif?t=1771358721\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.webm?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.mp4?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character customization</strong>: create your own drummer with a robust character creator, and find clothing pieces to evolve your look throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.poster.avif?t=1771358721\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.webm?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.mp4?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-ended musical sandbox</strong>: Sequence up to 6 musicians simultaneously to create your own masterful compositions, with animations synced to your every note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.poster.avif?t=1771358721\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.webm?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.mp4?t=1771358721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646020?t=1771358721","background_raw":"https://s